window.products.push({"id":443006,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 1 lb Carnelian Rough Stones from Madagascar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vfh+WWGtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Fantasia brand of Carnelian rough is 100% natural and imported by the ton directly from our partner mine in Madagascar to Fantasia Mining's 90,000 square foot warehouse in Ohio.Stone Size: 1\" to 1.5\" per piece average.Pieces per lb: 13 to 25Color: Orange, Brown, Red, Yellow, WhiteThe sizes, pieces per lb, and colors are averages over thousands of pounds of this material. It is possible to get pieces outside of the size range listed or with other variances in shapes, color shades, patterns, clarity, translucency, number of pieces or other characteristics which can vary each time natural stones are mined. These stones are perfect for tumbling, polishing, cabbing, cutting, wire wrapping or keeping in their natural form as a specimen.VERY IMPORTANT: This is rough natural material which means you are receiving it exactly how it came out of the ground. All pictures were taken with the stones being wet which helps to show the materials true colors and clarity. It may not have the same appearance when dry unless it has been polished, tumbled, cabbed or worked in some way. On rare occasion some pieces may also have a sawn edge due to the way it is extracted from the earth.Scientific Properties:Group: Silicate: SilicaChemical Formula: SiO2Specific Gravity: 2.58 - 2.64Moh's Hardness: 6.5 - 7.0Refractive Index: 1.530 - 1.540Metaphysical Properties:Primary Chakra: Solar Plexus, SacralAstrological Sign(s): Cancer, Taurus, Scorpio, LeoVibration Number: 5, 6","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vfh+WWGtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B07V9BQMVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9BQMVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9BQMVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
