window.products.push({"id":443189,"name":"Dress My Cupcake Biscuit Cutter, 4.5-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rEgiFIfeL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Dress My Cupcake is the world's largest manufacturer of dessert table supplies and couture party decor. Our best selling product line includes designer cupcake wrappers, tissue paper pom poms, cupcake stands, cake pop supplies, crystals, vintage straws, washi tape, glitter ribbon, dessert sticks, DIY wooden cutlery kits, and so much more. Dress My Cupcake offers designer cupcake wrappers in over 500 colors and styles, that provide an elegant look to your cupcakes by hiding wrinkly cupcake liners. Dress My Cupcake products have been used to create festive candy buffets and dessert tables at all types of special events, including weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, birthdays, college events, bar and bat mitzvahs, corporate events, Hollywood galas and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rEgiFIfeL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dress My Cupcake","source_asin":"B00BFDHUSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BFDHUSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BFDHUSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443190,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. Clipped Jacquard Tufted Diamond Pattern Boho Duvet Cover Bedding Set with Zipper and Corner Ties, Soft Bedspread 3-Piece ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91obF8R4PiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to update your bedroom with a quality duvet cover set bedding bedspread? Our oversized clipped jacquard tufted duvet cover set fits the bill. These unique duvet cover sets are high-quality, and come with matching shams. These duvet cover sets are made with our signature textured pattern solid color microfiber soft fabric that is light weight and extremely soft, shrinkage free, fade resistant. You will wake up fresh and well rested with these cozy oversized bedding sets. Full / Queen Size duvet cover set is a 3-Piece Set and contains one duvet cover: 92 inch wide x 92 inch long and two shams: 20 in wide x 26 in long. Shams have an envelope enclosure and completely hide your pillows. The bold, yet simply pattern of textured yarns woven into the fabric of duvet cover set creates a dramatic impact to your bedroom instantly. With this one duvet cover, you can introduce depth and texture to your bedroom. High quality craftsmanship & signature soft fabric: Woven with double-brushed soft microfiber yarns, this duvet cover set will soften with each wash. it comes with a zipper closure for your insert and 4 corner ties to hold your insert at each corner. There are so many ways these bedding sets can be used. You can layer it to add depth, or you can simply use it on its own. whether it is farmhouse bedding, boho style, or modern décor, these duvets will instantly transform your bedroom. Multi-purpose and versatile. These oversized tufted duvet cover sets can be used on their own or as a layer with other bedding. These Queen and full size duvet cover bedding sets and bedspreads can be used in any type of décor. You can quite easily use them in simply chic urban loft setting, farmhouse bedding, French country décor, bohemian bedding style, or in simple minimalist setting. Our duvet cover bedding sets are wrinkle, fade and pilling Resistant. These tufted clipped jacquard bedding sets are high-quality and made with our signature double-brushed luxurious and soft microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness. They are machine washable and will continue to get softer with each wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91obF8R4PiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B0B1PGMP1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1PGMP1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1PGMP1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
