window.products.push({"id":443210,"name":"Messermeister 4 1/2-Inch High Carbon Forged Stainless Steel Steak Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vTpHhMECL._AC_SL1485_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Messermeister San Moritz Elité knife collection have a completely molded, ergonomic and contemporary handle. The blade, bolster and tang are one-piece, hot-drop, hammer forged from a single billet of the finest German steel alloy. Featuring a unique personalization plate, this series of knives will be a statement piece in any kitchen. San Moritz Elité knives are handcrafted individually by 3rd and 4th generation cutlery artisans in Solingen, Germany. The German 1.4116 high-carbon, stainless alloy blade resists stains and corrosion, exhibits toughness and durability, holds its edge retention, and is easy to re-sharpen to a razor-like edge. The German 1.4116 high-carbon, stainless alloy blade resists stains and corrosion, exhibits toughness and durability, holds its edge retention, and is easy to re-sharpen to a razor-like edge. This knife line is one-piece, hot-drop hammer forged, which produces the strongest blade from heel to tip. The blades are heat treated and cooled to achieve a Rockwell of 57-58. This knife line is one-piece, hot-drop hammer forged, which produces the strongest blade from heel to tip. The blades are heat treated and cooled to achieve a Rockwell of 57-58. The three-step, 15° Elité edge is hand stropped on a cloth wheel, creating the sharpest possible cutting surface on an edged tool. The three-step, 15° Elité edge is hand stropped on a cloth wheel, creating the sharpest possible cutting surface on an edged tool. The bolsterless heel simplifies all cutting, sharpening and honing tasks, making use of the entire blade from heel to tip. The bolsterless heel simplifies all cutting, sharpening and honing tasks, making use of the entire blade from heel to tip. Handcrafted in the historic cutlery capital of Solingen, Germany. Handcrafted in the historic cutlery capital of Solingen, Germany. The Knife for Life guarantee provides a lifetime warranty against material and manufacturing defects. The Knife for Life guarantee provides a lifetime warranty against material and manufacturing defects. Amazon.com This is Messermeister's first-rate San Moritz steak knife. Forged from a single piece of high-carbon stainless steel, the knife's 4-1/2-inch blade has a shortened bolster so it's sharp from tip to heel. The 9-inch table knife is specially designed to slice a thick steak, pork chop, or beef roast into bite-size pieces. Though its blade is serrated on the upper half and tends to tear meat fibers rather than slice precisely through them the way a straight-edge knife does, fine serrations reduce the tearing effect, and the blade's lower half is straight. Molded from a polymer that won't crack or warp, the handle is tough and contains a nearly full tang. To keep the blade sharp, it's best to hand wash this knife in soapy water. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vTpHhMECL._AC_SL1485_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messermeister","source_asin":"B00004XS07","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004XS07","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004XS07","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
