window.products.push({"id":443305,"name":"Christmas Moose Mug & Dickie Package","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jHLysrU3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"We're all in this together. This is a full-blown, four-alarm holiday emergency here. \"Tis the Season to Be Merry.... A&R Collectibles is pleased to offer our Christmas Moose Mug & Dickie Package. These are ONE PIECE custom made Acrylic Moose Mugs. Made of lightweight, crystal clear acrylic, which is far superior to plastic with the added benefits of being a stronger and safer alternative to glass. Size: Width 8.25\" (antler tip to antler tip, Front to Back 4.25\" (includes snout), Height: 6.25\". Holds 8 oz. of your favorite beverage...eggnog of course! Dishwasher safe and individually packaged in a holiday gift box. (Note: Dishwasher safe top rack only. Hand wash recommended). Our dickie is one size fits most and is a nice soft but stretchy rib material, made of 100% pre shrunk cotton. Dickie measures 14\" in length (from collar to base), 16\" from one shoulder to the other and the collar is 2 1/4\" wide. Made in USA. Imagine the look on your friends faces as they see you drinking from a moose mug....wearing a Black Dickie! Compared to all others, these are the only ONE PIECE moose mugs on the market with 8 ounce capacity. All others have glued on antler ears and are much smaller. Don't just take our word for it, read some of the recent feedback we have received for our acrylic moose mugs: - *I like the fact that they're acrylic so I won't have to be concerned about breaking them. - *Very well made and very handsome looking. - *I chose the acrylic mug sold here as they are easy to handle, especially for the little ones who love the mug also. - *My best Amazon purchase ever\" - *YOU CAN REALLY USE THESE MUGS. You can hold them on the antlers when they are completely filled\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jHLysrU3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christmas Moose","source_asin":"B000Z71DHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Z71DHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Z71DHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443306,"name":"Sexfoil Carved Birch Bark Wood Jewelry Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5109WgWfw+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Sexfoil Carved Jewelry Box This beautiful box is handmade in Russia out of birch bark.Unique, Useful, Hand Made, Organic: this box is awesome gift!Hand made and decorated by a talented and a professional Russian artisan. 3 1/3 inches (~8cm) by 2 (~5.3 cm) inches high. Volume: 4.3 US fluid ounces (~0.13 liters) The whole collection is 100% handmade entirely of birch bark harvested in the wild in Russia and is full of uniqueness, distinctive nuances and delicate touches.Birch bark containers are used to store groats, spices, flour, sugar, tea etc.Quality products made from birch bark will keep out moisture and bugs, helping your food stay fresh longer.Every item is handmade and without exaggeration one can say that each article is its own work of art.Birch tree bark is an ecologically clean fabric with antibacterial properties.Bread boxes, cylinder shaped containers, cups, biscuit barrels and other kitchen and household utensils made of birch bark will decorate your kitchen, and keep you food stuffs safe and clean.MadeOfBirchBark brand is pleased to offer a wide assortment of Siberian birch bark souvenirs created in line with the old traditions and techniques of Russian Siberia.Among our assortment of products you will find trinket and jewelry boxes, hair accessories, food storage jars and containers, birch bark tues canisters of various sizes and for various purposes, plates, trays, salt & pepper shakers, cups, mugs and many other implements handcrafted from the organic bark of birch tree.Plates and dishes, candy bowls, napkin holders, bread baskets, jars and boxes can be very useful at home. No matter how you decide to use them, they are beautiful pieces you’ll want to display.Goods Made Of Birch Bark make a great gift for any occasion! MadeOfBirchBark","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5109WgWfw+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeOfBirchBark","source_asin":"B016PM2KBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016PM2KBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016PM2KBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
