window.products.push({"id":443392,"name":"Vanilla Brick Soap Dispenser Wall Mount Hand Soap Dispenser for Bathroom Shower Dispenser Shampoo and Conditioner Dispenser for Shower Wall Mounted So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rDDN9pI4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Making your life simple. Enhancing the look and function of your bathroom, shower, or kitchen. Making your home simply yours. That is our mission at Vanilla Brick.We designed our manual dispensers to be durable, easy to use and refill. Large capacity means less refilling. Never run out again, with the clear visibility window. When it comes time to refill, we have made it simple. No special refill bags, just fill with your favorite liquid or gel.Easy to pump, and releases the perfect amount every time. Great for kids or commercial use. Works best with thicker liquid or gel.Create space- Running low on counter space in your bathroom, kitchen, RV, work shop or garage? Your new wall mounted dispenser can help you organize and make those spaces look better and work more efficiently. Great for shampoo and conditioner or shower gel. One easy to use, easy to fill place for your favorite product. And no more bottles tipped up side down, to get every last drop, that end up falling all over the shower floor.First Use Recommendations- To make priming the dispenser easier, fill with water and pump until it comes out. This can take 10-30 pumps. Then dump out the water, fill with your favorite soap etc. and your good to go!Mounting- For worry free results, we recommend using the included hardware to mount to the wall. If you are wanting to install the holder without drilling, we have had customers recommend the following method. Using a good two sided tape, or bathroom command strips, and silicone glue. First, stick a piece of the tape on the top and sides, of the back of the dispenser mount. (These will hold the dispenser while the silicone sets). Put a line of the silicone along the outside edge of the mounting plate. Place in desired location and press firmly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rDDN9pI4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vanilla Brick","source_asin":"B08BK7J589","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BK7J589","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BK7J589","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
