window.products.push({"id":443434,"name":"NOKLEAD Digital Alarm Clock -4 Brightness LED Display,Snooze 12/24H, Adapter Power with Backup Battery, Easy Operated for Kids Seniors , Small Metal D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XcNaasxpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The NK5245 digital alarm clock is simple enough to read and set with clear LED display, 4 levels of brightness control, 12/24H time format and snooze. Its unique metal design, mini size and battery backup allows you to take it anywhere you need an alarm or clock. Take Anywhere Metal Alarm Clock The mini size (3.23\"*2.64\"*1.14\") makes it a portable alarm clock for you to put it anywhere on the bedside table, nightstand or desk in your home and office, or to put it in your handbag when you are travelling. Stylish design with metal shell build a sleek and elegant appearance, which is much more durable in daily use. LED Display with 4 Levels of Brightness Clear white digits with 4 levels of brightness from Off/Dim/Medium/Bright to meet the needs of different people.The time display support both 12/24H time format. Single Alarm and Snooze The alarm is super easy to set, standard beeping with a gradual volume (70-90dB) to make sure you wake up every morning. A simple press at the top when the alarm is ringing to extend 9 minutes of sleep. Adapter Powered and Backup Battery Powered via the USB DC 5V adapter (included) or connect to your laptop, power banks.The built-in 2 AAA batteries for saving all the setting in times of power outrage; The alarm could also ring and you can light up the display for 10 seconds with each press when there is no power. Extremely Easy to Use Independent buttons to set time and alarm, you can finish all the settings even do not need instructions.The dimmer and snooze button is specially designed on the bottom of the clock, saving your worries to grope in the dark of the button, you just need to press the top of the clock to light up the display or snooze. What You Get 1 x NK5245 Digital Alarm Clock1 x TYPE-C Cable1 x Adaptor1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XcNaasxpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOKLEAD","source_asin":"B089GN2LC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GN2LC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GN2LC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
