window.products.push({"id":443450,"name":"Magnolia Organics Flannel Sheet Set - Queen, London Fog","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6124KJrw6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This fuzzy flannel is the result of 5 years of research to make the warmest, comfiest fabric. Add this cozy insulating layer to your bed, tuck yourself in, and keep warm all night.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6124KJrw6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnolia Organics","source_asin":"B07M8YHJMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M8YHJMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M8YHJMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443451,"name":"Dough Bowl Candle Company Pumpkin Souffle Soy Candle - 3 Wick Candle Essential Oil Wax Melts, Rustic Farmhouse Decor Odor Eliminator, 20 Ounce All-Nat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611DVXs5D6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Little of That Quiet Rustic Charm Does a Soul Good.Hygge chic. It's just so good for the soul. It's got the right balance of warmth and coziness, with a touch of simplicity, to encourage well-being and a feeling of contentment. This long dough bowl candle helps usher in that rustic Danish aesthetic in no time - with a soft subtle pumpkin souffle fragrance, to boot. The soy based candles are 100% hand-poured soy wax into Spanish Oak bowls that are carefully inspected and quality assured, so you get the best three wick candle - that also doubles as country farmplace decor.Each package contains a hefty 2-pound baguette bowl candle, measuring 10\" x 6\". At first a lovely and aromatic wick pumpkin soffle scented dough bowl soy candle, then a part of your simple and impactful modern farmhouse decor collection, the large three wick candles are must-haves for every home. Infused with pumpkin souffle essential oil, the wooden bowls are crafted out of Spanish oak, and hand carved in Texas. Only 100% soy wax is put into each pumpkin souffle aromatherapy candle.Rest assured - the natural essential oils candles have been carefully vetted for quality. Each candle will give you up to 40 hours burn time, depending how often and long you light the candle for. The bowls are QC inspected for cracks and warping, ensuring only the sturdiest and most beautiful bowls are used to create these aromatherapy soy candles. We put 10% of scent into each candle - the best practice and optimum amount to achieve a subtle and fragrant ambience in your chosen space.Clean out the farmhouse dough bowl candles of wax when you're left with a quarter of the initial amount, and you can use the bowls for modern farmhouse decor. They double as a lovely centerpiece, a tray, a key holder, fruit bowls, planters, jewelry holders, or anything else you can imagine.Make sure you get the soy dough bowl candle as your next gift - for yourself or for someone special!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611DVXs5D6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dough Bowl Candle Company","source_asin":"B0B686TY5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B686TY5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B686TY5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
