window.products.push({"id":443598,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock for Bedroom, Mirrored Loud Clock Large Display with Night Light, Type C, USB Charging Ports, Dual Alarms, Dimmer, Snooze&Backup Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMc4QJo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📺【Large Display & Mirror Surface】: Digital alarm clock with a ultra-large 7\" LED display allows even the elderly and nearsighted, or those who are far away, to check the time at a glance. The bezel-less aesthetic and mirrored design are great for desktop decoration. With the combined mirror design, you can also use it as a mirror to prepare for makeup. The mirror surface is not easy to get dust, just a light wipe to restore the original clean appearance. 💡【Snooze & Night Light function】: Night Light Alarm Clock. Sensitive touch screen technology for quick response at the touch of a button. Snooze function supported. When our this alarm clock for bedroom goes off, touch the snooze button at the top of the alarm to get an extra 9 minutes of sleep, giving you a buffer before you get up. In addition, this alarm clock is equipped with night light function, long press the top snooze button to turn on the night light, the light is mild and not harsh, perfect for nighttime activities. ✨【7 Volume Levels & Quiet Sleeping Environment】: Our electric clock has 7(70-118 dB) levels of adjustable volume, rotate left to turn up, right to turn down. You can adjust the volume for your preference. In addition, our this digital alarm clocks are different from others, which don't keep ticking and disrupting your sleep quality. Our electronic alarm clock provides an absolutely quiet environment for your sleep. ⏰【0-100% Dimmer & Dual Alarm Clocks】: Considering the light sensitivity of people when sleeping at night, our led alarm clock is paired with full range digit brightness to choose from, so you can select the brightness you are most comfortable with. Dual alarm clock function meets people's various time reminder need, and both alarms can be turn on/off independently. 🔋【Dual USB Ports Design】:2 charging ports are designed on the back of the alarm clock for bedrooms: USB & TYPE-C (5V 1A). With 2 built-in USB charging ports, you can charge two electronic products at the same time, reducing the waste of adapters and saving space. Connect the adapter line to the DC jack and then plug it into a 100~240V AC wall outlet to use. In addition, 2 AAA batteries (not included) are used to memorize the time setting and the alarm will ring in case of power outage. ❤️【12H/24H Time Format & DST & Warranty】: The digital clock is also featured with 12 or 24 hour time format &Daylight Saving Time. The package includes:1x Digital Alarm Clock, 1x DC Adapter & USB Cable, 30-day unconditional refund and 18-month warranty, if there any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMc4QJo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roxicosly","source_asin":"B0BPBNTCZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBNTCZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBNTCZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
