window.products.push({"id":443631,"name":"Jet's Home Queen Waterproof Mattress Protector - Cooling Mattress Pad with Ultra Soft Quilted Mattress Cover Soft Breathable Machine Washable,Quiet No","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nqZ0hlnML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cooling fabric】the surface of this waterproof mattress protector is made of nylon (polyamide) fabric.It is the one kind of cooling fabrics which can absorb and spread heats quickly and keep you comfortable from getting too hot when you sleep on it. 【TIPS】 This mattress pad is packaged in a vacuum bag.It would be better to spread and pat It before using. Queen size mattress protector measures 60''x80'' and has deep pocket fits up to 17\" 【Waterproof & Breathable】Queen mattress protector can protect your mattress from all kinds of liquids like perspiration,urine,incontinence and fluid spills.this waterproof mattress protector can not only keep your mattress dry but also allow air to pass through to make it breathable and comfortable when you sleep on it.Thers is no plastic crinkling sounds.Have a sweet sleeping with our cooling waterproof queen mattress protector. 【Fitted Deep Pocket】 Mattress pad is quilted with one cooling surface fabric,one soft filling and one waterproof bottom layer.It is ultra soft and quiet,no crunching when you move around.this Queen mattress protector cover has a fitted stretched skirt with elastic band all around,which can fit well on the mattress without being too loose or too tight. 【Machine Washable & Easy Care】Our queen waterproof mattress pad cover is machine washable,You don't need to spend too much time,money and effort on maintaining our cooling mattress covers. this waterproof mattress protector can be Machine wash warm at gentle cycle,tumble dry at low heat only,remove promptly from dryer and lay flat,do not iron,do not bleach,do not dry clean your queen mattress protector. 【Oeko-Tex Certificate】 Our cooling mattress protector is certificated by Oeko Tex standard 100.We try to find more better materials to make our bed covers to create a wonderful rest space to you.Believe me, this cooling waterproof queen mattress protector is a right choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nqZ0hlnML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JET'S HOME","source_asin":"B09LQNRJ11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQNRJ11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQNRJ11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
