window.products.push({"id":443637,"name":"Smart Fairy Lights with Remote, 16.4 Ft Smart Christmas Tree Lights, Color Changing String Lights with Remote&App, Music Sync&Timer Control for Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRZSQhQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[📶Bluetooth Version] - Unlike the traditional Wifi smart string lights, this smart fairy lights connect with Bluetooth, which is easy to connect and has a very stable connection even for outdoor use. NOTE: These lights for room decor CAN NOT CONNECT MULTIPLE SETS TOGETHER, because each RGBIC has programmed, so the lights use itself's power. Since it is bluetooth one to one connection, it CAN'T not be group controlled. [💡Dimmable & Multiple Lighting Modes] - This bedroom lights has more than 20 modes and brightness settings give you a romantic and dreamlike atmosphere. These modes can be toggled with multiple controllers: Via Controller box: 3 music modes, 20 light modes; Via remote: 3 music modes, 20 light modes, 16 colors; Via “Hello Fairy” App: 3 music modes, multi light modes, 16 millions colors. This string lights with remote will be a perfect gift for your family, friends and Kids. [🔆Warm White Lights Compatible] - Different from other RGB string lights indoor, this string lights bedroom not only have 16 millions colors lights but also have warm white lights. Note, warm white lights only supported with \"Hello fairy\" app, not from Remote or Control box. USB powered and updated copper wire allow these waterproof led party wall lights to easily change shape. [🎵 Sync with Music] - DiamondTiger led string lights for bedroom have a built-in microphone that will sync with any music coming from the phone speaker or any other speaker in the room. This bluetooth sparkling twinkly hanging string lights will \"dance\" with the beats of music (or hands claps). This function is available on the “Hello Fairy” App and the included remote controller. Try it and enjoy the entertainment experience. [🌈Flowing Light Effects] - With the IC tech, DiamondTiger Smart fairy lights color changing for bedrooms allows each light on the whole string light to display different colors simultaneously and brighter than traditional copper wire christmas lights. This rainbow effect is ideal for bedroom, home, house, apartment, dorm, party, birthday, wedding, halloween, christmas, vacations, thanksgiving day indoor outdoor decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRZSQhQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DiamondTiger","source_asin":"B0BJNTS6YT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJNTS6YT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJNTS6YT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
