window.products.push({"id":443675,"name":"Unikito L Shaped Computer Desk with LED Strip and Power Outlets, Reversible L-Shaped Corner Desk with Storage Shelves and Bag, Industrial Gaming Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-33fDBg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Desk with USB Ports and Power Outlets】Our L-shaped desk is equipped with a built-in power strip with 4 Power outlets and 2 USB charging ports for your phone, tablet, printer or gaming gear with fast charging, which provides great convenience to your life when you are working or playing games. ✔️【Game table & Smart LED light】 The L shaped gaming desk with RGB LED lights provides more choices for gaming enthusiasts! It features over 60000 colors and 29 flashing modes via APP or remote control. With Led music sync function and built-in sensitivity adjustable mic, the color of led light will change with the rhythm of the sound and music. And with timer function, just enjoy it in a smart way, creating a gaming atmosphere. ✔️【Reversible Computer Desk】With reversible design, the storage shelves of our L-shape desk can be set on the left or right according to your use habits. And the height of storage open shelves under the desk can be adjustable. You can also choose a suitable height depending on your needs. ✔️【Abundant Storage Capacity】This computer desk comes with double desk, Top hutch, storage bag, under-desk bookshelf and two-tier storage shelves, which maximally utilize your home office space and provide enough space to place files, books and hosts within easy reach. Two large tabletops of 55\" and 47.2\" in different lengths can offer ample space for 3 monitors or screens, gaming activities, home office work, and other activities. ✔️【Durable & Sturdy Construction】 The L shaped computer desk is constructed by high-quality MDF board and rugged metal frame ensuring maximum durability and stability which can support up to 500 lbs. Its adjustable leg pads keep the desk sturdy even on uneven floors and its textured surface keeps the board anti-skidding, anti-scratching, and easy to clean. ✔️【Easy Assembly】This L desk comes with clear and detailed instructions, numbered parts to make assembling this sturdy home office desk as effortless as possible. If you have any questions about our office desk, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-33fDBg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unikito","source_asin":"B0BN4CH81F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN4CH81F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN4CH81F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
