window.products.push({"id":443702,"name":"Goeielewe French Press Coffee Maker, Heat Resistant Borosilicate Glass Coffee Pot Percolator, Coffee Brewer with Filtration, Tea Maker Filters (800ml/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p6qLWabFL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Features: 1. Food Grade Safety Material - Every single piece surpasses food grade quality requirements. The large carafe is made of thickened heat-resistant borosilicate glass, which can withstand boiling water. Perfect gift for coffee/tea lovers. 2. Upgraded Filtration System - One upgraded filter produces a double effect and helps minimize the amount of grounds better than others, giving you a cup of pure brewed coffee just like it is made by professionals. perfect for making fresh tea, espresso and even cold brew. 3. ser-friendly Design - Only 4 steps need to be taken to make one cup of coffee. Whether you are experienced or a first-time user, it is easy to get started. Every part of the press can be disassembled for cleaning. 4. Capacity: 350ml/11oz, 800ml/27oz, 1000ml/33oz for choose. 5. PP Non-slip Base: With the olecranon cup mouth, the pot is smooth and delicate. The high borosilicate hot and cold resistant glass mouth is smooth. The cup body uses PP cup holder and base, which is beautiful and durable.  Descriptions: -Material: Borosilicate Glass+PP -Capacity: 350ml/11oz, 800ml/27oz, 1000ml/33oz for choose -Size: 3.1x6.7 inches(350ml/11oz); 4.3x7.5 inches(800ml/27oz); 4.3x8.3 inches(1000ml/33oz) -Color: White  Package included: 1 x 1 French Press Coffee Maker","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p6qLWabFL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goeielewe","source_asin":"B08P3SCQF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P3SCQF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P3SCQF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443703,"name":"iSi Gourmet Brushed Stainless Steel Pint Whipped Cream Dispenser with Sparkwhip 24 Pack N2O Cream Chargers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HQhGYVjWL._AC_SL1302_.jpg","description":"Prepare whipped cream in mere seconds with the iSi Gourmet whipped cream dispenser with 24 pack of Sparkwhip N2O cream chargers. Made of brushed stainless steel, the dispenser is ideal for creating perfectly flavored whip cream, mousses, sauces, foams and a variety of imaginative dessert toppings. Simply add heavy whipping cream and sugar to the container and the rest is done for you. A pint of cream yields up to five times as much whipped cream and needs no additives or preservatives because you are making it fresh right in your very own kitchen. The dispenser includes three decorator tips and a charger holder, as well as a 24 pack of Sparkwhip N2O cream chargers. The cream chargers are made of 100% recyclable stainless steel with 7.5 grams in each canister. These canisters are made of the highest food grade quality and use a proprietary capping system to prevent gas leakage and extend the shelf life of the product. This set includes a five year guarantee from date of manufacture for the ultimate convenience. The whipped cream dispenser is dishwasher safe for easy cleanup while the cream chargers are recyclable after use. Dispenser -- 3-3/4\" L x 12-3/4\" W, with a 1 pint capacity; Chargers -- 2-1/2\" L, with a 7.5 gram capacity","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HQhGYVjWL._AC_SL1302_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iSi North America","source_asin":"B018F7QRLU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018F7QRLU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018F7QRLU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
