window.products.push({"id":443805,"name":"Tie Hanger -Flex Cloth Hanger with 12 Hooks for Ties, Belts and Clothing Accessories for Men and Women –360° Rotating Swivel Hook–Beautiful Walnut Woo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71USNoKLOhL._AC_SL1066_.jpg","description":"YOU NO LONGER NEED TO DIG THROUGH YOUR CLOSET FLOOR TO FIND YOUR FAVORITE BELT, NECKTIE, SCARF, SHAWL AND OTHER ACCESSORIES! Tired of looking for a solution that will not only organize your belts and other accessories but will also look beautiful and add some flair in your closets? Then this door clothes hanger is your best solution. Since the ties won’t overlap, you can easily pull one without having to disturb others. When not in use, the hook can be folded in to save space or give room for other things you want to hang. A Wonderful Gift Idea for Your Male Loved Ones and Friends! They say it is very difficult to get a male surprised with a beautiful present.That is why we created this innovative and useful Hanger for men, especially those who work in the office, a necktie is very useful.It Has something magical that makes them appear neat, respectable, and professional.So, of course, if a man has lots of ties, he will need something to keep them organized. And that is our amazing product. The Most Versatile Trouser Hangers! No more closet space? Then you can hang it on a wall hook or any rod in your home, heck you can even hang it on a nail!Because this is a typically shaped hanger with different uses, it still can be put in any part of your house.Need to hang kitchen towels on it? Then hang it on a wall hook by your kitchen.Want it in your bathroom? You can hang it on your bath towel rods or even on your curtain rod. Product Features: ✿ 12-Hooks for most Clothing Accessories✿ 360 Degree Swivel Hook to Easily Hang Over the Closet Rod✿ Beautiful Wooden Finish with Chrome Accents✿ Modern and Innovative Design✿ Save Time & Space✿ Extremely Portable and Handy - Great for Traveling It’s about time to do something about your closet clutter!Purchase the Florida Brands Hanger today and find out how it can work wonders in your messy closet!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71USNoKLOhL._AC_SL1066_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLORIDA BRANDS","source_asin":"B00AAQHSEK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AAQHSEK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AAQHSEK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
