window.products.push({"id":443838,"name":"iHappy Artificial Marble Counter Door Sticker Oil Proof PVC Paper 23x98 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEeocQypL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features: *High density PVC material, Waterproof, Moisture-proof, Anti-oil, Fireproof *Quick and easy decorating cover - applies in minutes, will look great for years *Easily trimmed to size with scissors or utility knife *Great for home decorations, can resurface your old looking kitchen units to a new one *Suitable for covering items such as furniture,flat kitchen cabinet doors, wardrobe, shelves,appliances,fridges, tile walls,freezers etc. Material: wipe clean PVC Size: approx. 60 x250 cm / 23.6 x 98.4 Inches Please allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. Package Includes: One Roll (If you purchase more than two rolls, we may package them in ONE Roll with the total length you ordered.) Instructions: 1. Cut the film into the size of where you want to apply it. 2. Clean the tiles wall/table/cupboard surface with detergent. 3. Spray some water on the surface. 4. Peel off the adhesive backing with your fingernail and paste it onto the surface. 5. Cover the film onto anywhere you want to paste, with your hands pressing it to the flat surface. 6. Scrape extra water and remaining air bubbles with a scraper. 7. Once more, uncover the film carefully. If not carefully, there will be some bubbles in it. You can prick them easily with a needle to make a tiny hole then use bank card to squeeze them out. 8. Trim around the edge with utility knife. Notice: Due to the light and screen differences, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. Please understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEeocQypL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iHappy","source_asin":"B010UYIGS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010UYIGS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010UYIGS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
