window.products.push({"id":443887,"name":"Intelligent Design Microfiber Bed Sheet Set Wrinkle Resistant, Soft Sheets with 12\" Pocket, Modern, All Season, and Cozy, Matching Pillow Case, Queen,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJNRDqY+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Intelligent Design Microfiber All Season Wrinkle-Free Sheet Set brings bold colors and soft comfort to your bed. This soft and smooth microfiber sheet set is naturally wrinkle-free and provides the perfect comfort all year long. These sheets are also OEKO-TEX certified, meaning they do not contain any harmful substances or chemicals, ensuring quality comfort and wellness. Set includes: 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, and 2 Pillowcases (1 in Twin/TwinXL). The fitted sheet fits up to a 14-inch mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJNRDqY+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intelligent Design","source_asin":"B09QJJ78D9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QJJ78D9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QJJ78D9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443888,"name":"Le Creuset Stoneware 8-Ounce Mini Round Cocotte, Lilac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bLFIY5a0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleek and stylish, this mini round cocotte by Le Creuset brings both beauty and versatility to any kitchen collection. The charming dish, which measures approximately 4-2/7 by 4-1/2 by 3 inches, provides a round compact shape and can hold up to 8 ounces. Styled after Le Creuset's legendary round French Ovens, the petite dish comes in handy for preparing and presenting individual portions or side dishes, and it can even be used as an attractive way to store spices. Made from durable stoneware, the cocotte features a hard-wearing, impermeable finish fired at temperatures as high as 2192 degrees F. With a porosity level of less than 1 percent, the dish blocks moisture absorption, so there's no chipping, cracking, crazing, or rippling along the interior to worry about. Its non-porous construction also resists odors, scratching, and staining for hygienic use and optimal cooking performance. Even more, its high-quality enamel protects against metal marks and other damage, which means it's safe for cutting on with knives. Best of all, the colorful glaze on the exterior makes the dish fun to mix and match with other coordinating Le Creuset pieces (sold separately), while a neutral-colored glaze on the inside offers a pleasing contrast and an optimal palette for food presentation. And thanks to its unmatched thermal resistance from -65 degrees F to 500 degrees F, the dish moves gracefully from the microwave or oven (or under the broiler) to the table for serving to the refrigerator or freezer for storing leftovers. The dish includes a secure-fitting lid--complete with concentric rings, raised Le Creuset lettering, and a round-shaped knob, and its loop side handles facilitate steady transport. When finished, the cocotte cleans up easily by hand or in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bLFIY5a0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B003F24D3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003F24D3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003F24D3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443889,"name":"Air Purifier for Room Large Room up to 600 sq.ft, VEWIOR H13 HEPA Filter with 6 Timer Settings, Aromatherapy, Quiet Air Cleaner for Dust Pet Dander Sm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61at2cJssIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"H13 True HEPA Filter & Monitoring Air Quality: VEWIOR air purifier with the 3-stage filtration system comprises of a pre-filter, HEPA filter, and an activated carbon filter. Efficiently purify PM 2.5, VOCs, pollen, smoke, pet dander, and air pollution. It detects air quality and displays PM2.5 (Reference valuealue)on the control panel to ensure healthy and comfortable fresh air. We recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months to ensure optimum performance of the air purifier. Efficient Purification & LED Touch Panel: VEWIOR air purifier can purify the air 5 times per hour in a room of 600 ft²/55m²effectively improving indoor air quality. The purifier has a high-definition LED touch panel and can display PM2.5, gear and timing. Modern design fits in any space from small to large rooms, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, nurseries, kitchens, and basements. 3 Fan Speed Settings & 6 Timer Settings: The fan speed can be selected accordingly. And VEWIOR air cleaner has three fan speed settings. The higher the fan speed, the stronger the purification effect. VEWIOR air cleaner has 6 timer settings, namely 2H, 4H, 6H, 8H, 10H, and 12H, which have more time-keeping modes than similar products and are very energy saving. Aromatherapy Diffuser: Built-in essential oil sponge, you can add a few drops of your favorite essential oils to the top of the air purifier. With the operation of the air purifier, it is able to effectively spread clean air and fresh fragrance throughout the room. Using VEWIOR air purifier after adding essential oils can effectively help us fall asleep. Filter Replacement Time: Depending on the quality of the air environment and the length of operation of the air purifier, we recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months to ensure the service life of the air purifier and to better provide fresher air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61at2cJssIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEWIOR","source_asin":"B09X9Q89JS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X9Q89JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X9Q89JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
