window.products.push({"id":443992,"name":"HOOSHU Easy Release 48 Large Double Layer Ice Cube Tray For Freezer With Lid Ice Trays For Freezer With Bin Splash-proof Release Cover Container Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FY80nyuFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy Release Ice Cube Mold】Ice cubes release easily with just a twist.The Silicone ice cube tray freezer with lid and bin is buckled upside down on the position of the ice box, and the lid is covered to press, then you will get ice cubes easily. Your hands will not touch the ice during the whole process. Your hands won't feel cold, and your ice cubes won't be contaminated with germs on your hands. 【Stackable Ice Storage Design】These Ice trays is the master of space saving. Size :11\"(L) x5\"(W) x 3.7\"(H) ，The 5 in 1 set includes: 1 ice cube tray with lid, 1 storage container, 1 ice scooper , 2 layers with 2 trays 48 grids .It doesn't take up much place in the fridge at all. 【SAFETY MATERIAL】Ice maker for freezer made of PP material which are certified , we use safe material to make Ice maker for freezer to ensure product safety. 【More Grids】This ice box for freezer contains 2 layers with 2 trays, you can get up to 48 ice cubes at one time. This can easily handle the need for ice cubes at home and parties. 【Good helper in the kitchen】Our ice cube trays can also be used in making Miniature dessert, such as Jelly, chocolate, baby food, frozon yogurt, perfect size for ice chewer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FY80nyuFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOOSHU","source_asin":"B0BNBMSG7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBMSG7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBMSG7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":443993,"name":"GAMA Electronics 2 ThermoServ Foam Insulated Coffee Mug 20 oz w/Lids (1) Blue & (1) Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WdAo91yTL._AC_.jpg","description":"A good coffee mug is like a comfortable pair of Jeans or your favorite boots - it just feels \"right\". For years the 20 oz mug was available at most Gas Stations and Convenience Stores. A few years ago they suddenly disappeared from the market and haven't been seen since. Well, we found the mold and arranged for a special production run of mugs. The ThermoServ mugs are great. They are double wall insulated and unlike other mugs on the market, they are foam filled so they are far superior at keeping drinks hot or cold. These rugged mugs are both dishwasher and microwave safe. The lid snaps on tight and doesn't leak out the sides like most of the Chinese imports! This listing is for one blue and one green mug. They both have black tops. There is no printing or graphics on these mugs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WdAo91yTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAMA Electronics","source_asin":"B003RY9VEM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-443993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003RY9VEM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003RY9VEM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
